---
/**
 * MiniAbout: black two-column intro.
 * Left: bold large tagline. Right: business description + hr + office/button row.
 */
---

<section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container about__grid">
    <div class="about__left">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">01 / About</p>
      <h2 class="about__tagline reveal" id="about-heading" style="--reveal-delay: 0.08s">
        A focused operator powering the next decade of energy trade.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about__right">
      <p class="about__lead reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.1s">
        We handle clean petroleum products, liquid bulk cargoes and lube oils
        across Ghana, the West African coast and worldwide, with a focus on
        safe operations, efficient voyage performance and the highest
        international standards.
      </p>
      <p class="about__meta reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.18s">
        Independent operator serving bulk buyers, resellers and industrial
        clients. One accountable partner from sourcing and storage to
        last-mile delivery.
      </p>

      <hr class="about__rule reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.22s" />

      <div class="about__foot reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.26s">
        <p class="about__office">Head Office · Accra</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-gold about__btn">Full Story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--bg);
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8.5rem) 0;
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.75rem;
  }

  .about__left .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }

  .about__tagline {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5.4vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .about__lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
  }

  .about__meta {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--faint);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .about__rule {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin: 2.2rem 0 1.6rem;
  }

  .about__foot {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .about__office {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
      gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about__left {
      position: sticky;
      top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2rem);
    }
  }
</style>
